---
// Transformations Showcase Component - Nexus Fitness Court
---

<section id="transformations" class="transformations-section" aria-labelledby="trans-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <div class="badge-nexus">
        REAL MEMBER RESULTS & REVIEWS
      </div>
      <h2 id="trans-heading" class="section-title">
        REAL PEOPLE. <span class="text-nexus">REAL TRANSFORMATIONS.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Dedicated members who stepped into Nexus Fitness Court on Besa Road, committed to the process, and completely transformed their physique.
      </p>

      <!-- Category Filter Pills -->
      <div class="filter-pills" role="tablist" aria-label="Transformation Filters">
        <button class="filter-pill active" data-category="all" role="tab" aria-selected="true">All Results</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-category="fat-loss" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Fat Loss to Recomp</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-category="muscle" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Muscle Building</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-category="strength" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Strength & Posture</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards Grid -->
    <div class="trans-grid" id="transformationsGrid">
      <!-- Card 1: Recomp -->
      <article class="trans-card glass-card" data-category="muscle fat-loss">
        <div class="trans-media-box">
          <img 
            src="/images/transformation-marcus.jpg" 
            alt="Nexus Fitness Court member 16 week body recomposition progress" 
            width="500" 
            height="380" 
            loading="lazy"
            class="trans-img"
          />
          <div class="trans-duration-chip">16 WEEKS PROTOCOL</div>
          <div class="trans-delta-pill">-14KG FAT &bull; +4KG LEAN MUSCLE</div>
        </div>
        <div class="trans-content">
          <div class="trans-meta">
            <h3 class="trans-name">Nitin Sharma</h3>
            <span class="trans-role">Nexus Member &bull; Software Professional</span>
          </div>
          <p class="trans-quote">
            "The trainers at Nexus Fitness Court tailored my routine around long sedentary desk hours. The Gymquip stations and guidance helped me drop 14kg of stubborn fat."
          </p>
          <div class="trans-metrics-row">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Starting BF</span>
              <span class="metric-val">27.4%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-divider"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Current BF</span>
              <span class="metric-val text-nexus">14.1%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-divider"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Bench Press</span>
              <span class="metric-val">+35 KG</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 2: Female Transformation -->
      <article class="trans-card glass-card" data-category="fat-loss strength">
        <div class="trans-media-box">
          <img 
            src="/images/transformation-sarah.jpg" 
            alt="Nexus Fitness Court member 12 week physique tone and stamina progress" 
            width="500" 
            height="380" 
            loading="lazy"
            class="trans-img"
          />
          <div class="trans-duration-chip">12 WEEKS PROTOCOL</div>
          <div class="trans-delta-pill">-11KG FAT &bull; TONED ABS & STRENGTH</div>
        </div>
        <div class="trans-content">
          <div class="trans-meta">
            <h3 class="trans-name">Pooja Deshmukh</h3>
            <span class="trans-role">Nexus Member &bull; Besa Resident</span>
          </div>
          <p class="trans-quote">
            "The unisex environment at Nexus Fitness Court is super welcoming and safe. The trainers helped me master proper form on squats and deadlifts without back pain."
          </p>
          <div class="trans-metrics-row">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Waist Size</span>
              <span class="metric-val">-12 CM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-divider"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Hip Thrust</span>
              <span class="metric-val text-nexus">105 KG</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-divider"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Energy Level</span>
              <span class="metric-val">10 / 10</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Card 3: Heavy Strength -->
      <article class="trans-card glass-card" data-category="muscle strength">
        <div class="trans-media-box">
          <img 
            src="/images/hero-athlete.jpg" 
            alt="Nexus Fitness Court member strength and muscle progression" 
            width="500" 
            height="380" 
            loading="lazy"
            class="trans-img"
          />
          <div class="trans-duration-chip">20 WEEKS PROTOCOL</div>
          <div class="trans-delta-pill">180KG DEADLIFT &bull; SUB-13% BF</div>
        </div>
        <div class="trans-content">
          <div class="trans-meta">
            <h3 class="trans-name">Amit Verma</h3>
            <span class="trans-role">Nexus Member &bull; Business Owner</span>
          </div>
          <p class="trans-quote">
            "The 45-degree leg press and heavy dumbbell arena with Captain America plates give an incredible pump. Truly Nagpur's best workout atmosphere on Besa Road."
          </p>
          <div class="trans-metrics-row">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Pull-ups</span>
              <span class="metric-val">18 Clean Reps</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-divider"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Deadlift PR</span>
              <span class="metric-val text-nexus">180 KG</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-divider"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="metric-lbl">Body Fat</span>
              <span class="metric-val">12.5%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA footer -->
    <div class="trans-footer-cta">
      <a href="#book-call" class="btn-primary">
        <span>Start Your Own Transformation</span>
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const filterPills = document.querySelectorAll('.filter-pill');
  const transCards = document.querySelectorAll('.trans-card');

  filterPills.forEach(pill => {
    pill.addEventListener('click', () => {
      filterPills.forEach(p => {
        p.classList.remove('active');
        p.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
      });
      pill.classList.add('active');
      pill.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');

      const targetCategory = pill.getAttribute('data-category');

      transCards.forEach(card => {
        const categories = card.getAttribute('data-category') || '';
        if (targetCategory === 'all' || categories.includes(targetCategory)) {
          (card as HTMLElement).style.display = 'block';
          (card as HTMLElement).style.animation = 'fadeIn 0.3s ease forwards';
        } else {
          (card as HTMLElement).style.display = 'none';
        }
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .transformations-section {
    padding: 6.5rem 0;
    position: relative;
    background: #08090e;
  }
  .section-header {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
    }
  }
  .section-sub {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .filter-pills {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .filter-pill {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .filter-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .filter-pill.active {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #0b0c10;
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.4);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .trans-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .trans-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .trans-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .trans-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all var(--transition-smooth);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .trans-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--border-nexus);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15);
  }

  .trans-media-box {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }
  .trans-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .trans-card:hover .trans-img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .trans-duration-chip {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    background: rgba(7, 8, 11, 0.88);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-nexus-subtle);
    color: var(--primary);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .trans-delta-pill {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    background: rgba(14, 16, 23, 0.92);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .trans-content {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .trans-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .trans-name {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .trans-role {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .trans-quote {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .trans-metrics-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .metric-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .metric-lbl {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .metric-val {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .metric-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 28px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .trans-footer-cta {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
